# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scraped / derived datasets — keep local, never commit.
#
# These files hold public-profile scrapes of thousands of real people (handle,
# display name, bio, location, follower count) and verbatim third-party tweet
# text. Scraped tweet text has also been observed to contain live API keys that
# other people published themselves; republishing those here would leak someone
# else's credential. This repository's history is world-readable, so the whole
# class stays out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
