#
# Each of these embeds one or more of: Feishu Base app tokens / table ids /
# group chat ids, the KOL outreach playbook (DM copy, free-credit offer, GID
# claim flow), or product names that are not publicly announced. None of it is
# a secret on its own, but together it is internal operating detail that does
# not belong in a public repo.
